{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A cross platform Mecha-Moe bullet hell Souls-Like</strong>, exploration, sandbox, boss hunting, all that good stuff.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>It plays like a classic twin stick shooter on keyboard</strong>, using WASD to move and your mouse to aim.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>At the time of writing this(1.0.1), the current build has:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Maidbots:</strong> 21 Maidbots, from basic shooters to advanced supports and fighters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cloud saves: Register to play in multiple devices, check out the website for more info.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Voice Acting:</strong> The Maidbots are voiced by professional Anime, TV/film and game VAs. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>12 Bosses</strong> from basic to two stage Final Bosses, <strong>30</strong> different enemy types, all from basic to extreme complexity</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrades and buffs that enable different builds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">6 City Districts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2 Dungeons with different mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cloud saves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Android version to which you can transfer your save to, check the website for details</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Community Driven Maidbot Production:</strong> You vote for your favorites, and suggest your own design ideas, I'll develop the game listening to those.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br>The Maidbots have very diverse skill kits, from healers, to tanks, area of effect, dasher and more, you get to combine their skills with several buffs you find in game for a more powerful build.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>MANGA: VITAKROSIS, the first Mahou-Shoujo manga made in Uruguay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2641420/extras/back.png?t=1744505979\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Thanks to the Kickstarter campaign, the official manga is here, available to read for free online or get physical copies, check the website for more info.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> <strong>FUNDED ON KICKSTARTER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lots of cool stuff coming soon thanks to the community, a graphic and story rebuild, an original song by the voice of Memorimo, original cosplay and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Made by one dude with a lot of coffee.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Playing Vindictive Drive 1 is not required to understand the plot.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2641420?t=1744505979","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2641420/bc826f408039fe81a4a573ba29d9011e44f1f204/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744505979","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2641420/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744505979","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2641420/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744505979","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game may contain content not appropriate for all ages, or may not be appropriate for viewing at work: Frequent Violence and blood, drug use is also mentioned in dialogues."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A cross platform Mecha-Moe bullet hell Souls-Like</strong>, exploration, sandbox, boss hunting, all that good stuff.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>It plays like a classic twin stick shooter on 